│   -                Volume down          │  Theme source      ‹ static ›                       │                                          │
│   _                Mute                 │  Theme name        ‹ ytm-dark ›                     │                                          │
│   >                Seek forward         │  Transparent       [ ]  C-t                         │                                          │
│   <                Seek backward        │  Selection style   ‹ solid ›  (transparent on…      │                                          │
│   ^                Restart track        │  Popup fill        [ ]                              │                                          │
│   l                Like / unlike current│  Album art         ‹ auto ›                         │                                          │
│   D                Discovery mix        │  Enforce contrast  [x]                              │                                          │
│                                         │  Live reload       [x]                              │                                          │
│ Navigation                              │                                                     │                                          │
│   j, down, C-n     Move down            │ ←/→ change · space toggle · enter save · esc cancel │                                          │
│   k, up, C-p       Move up              ╰─────────────────────────────────────────────────────╯                                          │
│   C-f, page_down   Page down                                                                                                             │
│   C-b, page_up     Page up                                                                                                               │
│   g g, home        Go to top (or row N with a count)                                                                                     │
│   G, end           Go to bottom (or row N with a count)                                                                                  │
│   enter            Select / open                                                                                                         │
│   tab              Focus next panel                                                                                                      │
│   S-tab            Focus previous panel                                                                                                  │
│   C-w h            Focus pane to the left                                                                                                │
